{"time": 1757681587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119957724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“但是我没醉啊啊啊啊啊啊，现在也没醉咕噜咕噜”"}
